&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with data center infrastructure components (e.g., UPS, CRAC, rack/power management).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to lead process improvements and service automation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
