&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

