&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in managing, leading, and inspiring a team of engineers, including hiring, retaining, and managing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
