&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: .0001pt;&quot;&gt;BAYADA &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Home Health Care is seeking a Registered Nurse (RN) to fill the position of&lt;strong&gt; Home Health Nurse Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our &lt;strong&gt;Kennebunk, ME &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Medicare Certified home health office. This office provides best-in-class care to adult and geriatric clients throughout York and Cumberland County.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: .0001pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-scope ng-binding&quot;&gt;This role would be a great fit for someone seeking a Mon- Fri schedule with &lt;strong&gt;NO weekends.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
