&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for an exciting opportunity in one of the fastest growing areas of healthcare that will allow you to make a difference in people&#39;s lives while you grow your career? We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;, a leading home health care company—and we believe that our clients and their families deserve home health care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability. In this dynamic environment, you will have the chance to apply your entrepreneurial and relationship-building skills and lead a caring, professional team that is instrumental in providing the highest quality care to our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
